step Rescue OOX-09/HL!
  zone map 1425
  tip Starts from the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, a random drop from Hinterlands mobs: use it for Find OOX-09/HL!, then the escort.
  complete 836 "Rescue OOX-09/HL!"
  turnin 836 "Rescue OOX-09/HL!" npc 7406 "Oglethorpe Obnoticus" map 1434 @28.4,76.4

step Jammal'an the Prophet
  zone map 1425
  tip Jammal'an is a boss in the Sunken Temple, in the Lair of the Chosen with Ogom the Wretched. · Kill them both and loot the Head of Jammal'an. · Hold it until you're back in the Hinterlands to give it to the Atal'ai Exile. · ~6,550 XP.
  complete 1446 "Jammal'an the Prophet"
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

step Only with a group
  zone map 1425
  accept 2994 "Saving Sharpbeak" @9.8,44.5 -- hold it

step Dungeon
  zone map 1445
  tip New Forever dungeon (48-55). · No quest needed: you just need the final boss for Legacy.
  task "Alcaz Island Prison" optional

